<overview>
<p>Taurian infantry reflect the Concordat's citizen-soldier tradition, with national service requirements ensuring that most adults have received basic military training before ever donning a uniform. Mechanized wheeled platoons offer a balance of speed and economy, their wheeled transports being cheaper to maintain than hover or tracked alternatives. For a military that must stretch limited resources across a significant number of garrison worlds, this cost efficiency matters as much as tactical performance.</p><p>Armed with standard ballistic assault rifles, the most common and affordable infantry weapon in the Inner Sphere, these platoons deliver reliable short-range firepower and can be equipped and resupplied from almost any garrison stockpile.</p>
</overview>

